+description: Report a suspected security vulnerability in a public Versat Labs repository privately.
+body:
+  - type: markdown
+    attributes:
+      value: |
+        Use this form only through GitHub's private "Report a vulnerability" flow.
+        For ordinary functional bugs, use the repository's Bug report issue form.
+        For private repositories, email the relevant CODEOWNERS using existing internal Versat channels.
+        Do not include credentials, personal or customer data, or unnecessary sensitive attachments.
